'''Coralito's Signature''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Diamond Flask}} that grants additional damage over time multiplier for poisons from critical strikes during its effect.

{{Item acquisition}}

==Ruthless mode==
Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a flask duration of 4.00 seconds instead.

==Legacy variants==
Coralito's Signature has a [[legacy variant]].

{{legacy variant table header}}
{{legacy variant table row|3.15.0|
* {{c|mod|Take 30 Chaos Damage per Second during Flask effect}}
* 25% chance to Poison on Hit during Flask effect
* Your Critical Strikes do not deal extra Damage during Flask effect
* {{c|mod|(50-75)% increased Duration of Poisons you inflict during Flask effect}}
* {{c|mod|Grants Perfect Agony during Flask effect}}}}
{{Legacy variant table end}}

==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.15.0|
* The Coralito's Signature unique flask no longer grants 50-75% increased Duration of Poisons you inflict during Flask effect, or grants Perfect Agony during effect. Now has 'Take 200-300 Chaos Damage per Second during flask effect' (previously 30), and now grants 'Poisons you inflict with Critical Strikes have +20-30% to Damage over Time Multiplier'. Existing items can be updated to the new Chaos Damage per Second modifier values with a Divine Orb.
* Diamond Flask no longer grants 'Your Critical Strike Chance is Lucky'. It now grants 100% increased Critical Strike Chance.
* The Surgeon's Flask Prefix can now roll on Diamond Flasks.
* Diamond Flask item class now "Utility Flasks" instead of "Utility Flask Critical".<ref name="Expedition item filter info" />
}}
{{Version history table row|3.1.0|
* Introduced to the game.
}}
{{Version history table end}}

